OL,3,AHayden Panettiere: A life of struggles
OL,4,Aalongside screen success
OL,5,
OL,6,FHayden Panettiere, who has died at the
OL,7,Fage of 36, lived most of her life in
OL,8,Fthe spotlight - from success as a child
OL,9,Fstar to lead roles in hit TV shows
OL,10,FHeroes and Nashville - but also endured
OL,11,Fstruggles that went along with the
OL,12,Fpressures of fame.
OL,14,FPanettiere appeared in her first
OL,15,Fcommercial when she was 11 months old.
OL,16,FHer mother Lesley Vogel was an actress
OL,17,Fand set her daughter on the same path.
OL,19,FBy the age of four, Hayden was in US TV
OL,20,Fshow One Life to Live, then at eight
OL,21,Fjoined another soap opera, Guiding
OL,22,FLight.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
